  "body": "## Problem\n\nPR #1825 added `site/tests/test_operation_reference.py`. It pins the 44 operation\npictures against the `OpType` enum. Nothing runs it. `cargo xtask gate` covers\nRust suites only. The `site` job in `release.yml` runs `zola build` but not this\nPython test. No other workflow calls it.\n\nA later PR that adds an `OpType` kind can forget its reference section and its\npicture view. No gate fails, so the site stays incomplete without a signal.\n\n## Fix\n\nRun the test from the `site` job of `release.yml`, next to the Zola build.\nAdd the run command to `site/README.md` so contributors know it exists.\nKeep the test's Zola arm skippable when the binary is absent, as today.\n\n## Done means:\n\n- A cut run executes `test_operation_reference.py` in the site job.\n- The job fails when a picture view or a reference section is missing.\n\nRefs #1250\n",
